# The local build123d venv, used to read the installed library's own source.
# The engine itself runs in the container; this is a development convenience.
.venv-cad/

# The labelled corpus's drawings and results: generated by
# `scripts/make_labelled_drawings.py` from a fixed seed, so the sheets are
# reproducible and there is no reason to carry a hundred PNGs in the history.
# What is worth keeping is the summary, and that goes in docs/acceptance/.
.local/
